{"name": "Kritter: Defend Together", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kritter: Defend Together</strong> blends tower defense, party game, and roguelite elements. Solo or with up to 4 players, your goal is to protect M. Ark, the coolest spaceship in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/7c15ed75032ce8944b0bc7bd8b6f81d0.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/7c15ed75032ce8944b0bc7bd8b6f81d0.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/7c15ed75032ce8944b0bc7bd8b6f81d0.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR ROLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend M. Ark at all costs against waves of hostile enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the surroundings, gather resources, strengthen your base, and grow stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die. Yes, sorry, it\u2019s part of the deal. But everything you\u2019ve gained will carry over to your next run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/3309d5381fb6833d78caca0fda0cd3e4.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/3309d5381fb6833d78caca0fda0cd3e4.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/3309d5381fb6833d78caca0fda0cd3e4.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/a007e23fc2383bc8fdf94105a2884354.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between waves, take advantage of the downtime to gather valuable resources.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find power-ups to craft a devastating build for your Kritter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect building materials to upgrade your defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter random events across 3 different procedurally generated levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/9e24b3699f2a54c9b40ea4c4c81af76d.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/9e24b3699f2a54c9b40ea4c4c81af76d.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/9e24b3699f2a54c9b40ea4c4c81af76d.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">According to the Manual, we're going to need resources to craft ramparts, turrets, and traps to facilitate our survival. It also advises staying alert, as certain events might occur during exploration: arena fights, bases containing upgrade chests, patrols offering gold and resources... Well, this Manual knows a lot of things!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/66d5299fd9d871e0c6e323c9783158fa.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waves of enemies will crash onto M. Ark at regular intervals. Your job is to take them down!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anticipate incoming enemies and make it back to M. Ark in time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight using one of 4 classes (Defender, Tracker, Engineer, and Ninja)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build defenses (walls, traps, turrets\u2026)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The better your defense, the higher your rank\u2014and the better your rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/d130e226fd605fbc9e102fb872bfa85c.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/d130e226fd605fbc9e102fb872bfa85c.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/d130e226fd605fbc9e102fb872bfa85c.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/55e5619df1e1d9524b21728af1fcf4b1.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"26\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/5cc3ad50f02b4832e01f2a5bcfd46879.webp?t=1787149751\" width=\"222\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a run, your choices are key to gaining as much power as possible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each successful wave, choose between 3 rewards: more damage? Repair M. Ark? A small health potion? Your call</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base buildings to boost your economy and gain more exploration time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All run-based upgrades are temporary and disappear at the end of the run\u2026 all except Soul Crystals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/e866e03a4f8c02bbe8ed53b2c1aeb8c3.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/e866e03a4f8c02bbe8ed53b2c1aeb8c3.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/e866e03a4f8c02bbe8ed53b2c1aeb8c3.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"26\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/68e3612326acee44f32983b51508eb88.webp?t=1787149751\" width=\"181\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No worries, it happens to the best of us. M. Ark will simply trigger a temporal rewind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All your upgrades will be lost except your Soul Crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use them to unlock permanent upgrades: a radar, a merchant, a second wall row\u2026 and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run helps you improve your talent tree and come back stronger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/834ab6a80f9c9e2042c1b5d61f0d9378.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/834ab6a80f9c9e2042c1b5d61f0d9378.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/834ab6a80f9c9e2042c1b5d61f0d9378.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/261b56c86ffa9ffe3a99e75b990e321b.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock all items in the game for even more synergies and combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode unlocks after beating normal mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endless mode with a leaderboard to see who can reach the highest wave in the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A speedrun mode to find out who\u2019s the fastest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/d423a16946745accb762e34130601c08.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kritters will also have the possibility to change model among:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Defender:</strong> Melee specialist, more robust. Make pretty windmills with your sword and turn your enemies into salami.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Engineer:</strong> Fancy a little extraterrestrial barbecue? With their flamethrower and turret, they are perfect for area damage and covering multiple fronts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Tracker:</strong> The long-range Kritter, specialized in explosives and precision shots! A small mine here, a missile there, and bam, done.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ninja:</strong> Swift and sharp, he doesn\u2019t hold back. Faster than his peers, he dashes through enemies to lacerate them and rains down kunais from a distance. Simple, clean, and lethal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more to come...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/5319c3355e5a7f261470615edec27964.poster.avif?t=1787149751\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/5319c3355e5a7f261470615edec27964.webm?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/extras/5319c3355e5a7f261470615edec27964.mp4?t=1787149751\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Manual stops there. It doesn't seem to indicate any other steps... Nevertheless, it offers us \"its most sincere condolences\" and \"will report the loss of you and the Kritters to your families.\" Nice of it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready, Kritters? <strong>TO YOUR POSITIONS!</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore, loot, and rush back to defend your ship against alien hordes. Solo or 4-player coop, grow stronger run after run in this frantic action roguelite with a touch of tower defense.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103950/25256065b1e16169dc2fc4ef9d7ca4f7abefd5d2/header.jpg?t=1787149751", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Roguelite", "Co-op", "Bullet Heaven", "Tower Defense", "Shoot 'Em Up"], "developers": "LJF Games", "publishers": "LJF Games", "release_date": "Mar 10, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "2103950", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/PdK_NmsozO0", "first_seen": 1787011200.0}